{"title":"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the sum of the squares of the roots, real or complex, of the system of simultaneous equations\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/1/7b193b6e52c09887b58c924c79455a53d7c919bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y+z=3,~x^2+y^2+z^2=3,~x^3+y^3+z^3 =3.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"396\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The roots are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, and we add the squares:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/a/3da4045aa2f27c71d36e065dcea56e174350573a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2+y^2+z^2=\\boxed{003}\\]\" width=\"159\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Wiki/index.php/1973_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4\">http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Wiki/index.php/1973_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4</a>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007\">Mock AIME 2 2006-2007</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t={{{source}}}\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 